{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d078ed6cd7e26064b70df5a2d6765a390514e0f5aa6bbdcce80b9b2d140e71ad", "ja": "（ふわぁ。書類仕事ばかりしていると眠くなるな……。\nいや、これもアイドルたちのためだ！　頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（呼啊。一直做文书工作的话，还真会犯困啊……\n不，这也是为了偶像们！加油吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "6bd00231d5398cc7bf6a4b6f42fb61da8592c8b4777e9afdedb850301c737c6e", "ja": "お疲れ様、{$P$}！\n今、ちょっといい？　もしかして、忙しい？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n现在方便吗？是不是在忙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8f1d46e83f875007ea4feab1e051e427385174d052a78ec17226d5db43956b07", "ja": "あれ？　響じゃないか。\nたしか今日はオフだったよな？", "zh": "咦？这不是响吗。\n我记得你今天休息吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "55538426ed921626837b995e3fa1f9b57268b95a7116849dd91236e82ae98b38", "ja": "うん！　これからいぬ美たちと一緒に、\nドッグパークに行くところ！　その途中で寄ったんだ。", "zh": "嗯！我正要和犬美它们一起去狗狗公园！路上顺便过来了一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1004_p", "source_sha256": "486ddef8a8b599e93213d1ce2d1b91f1100b8b2acda01359b41aa648ad374386", "ja": "おお、それは楽しそうだな。オシャレしてるから、\n出かけるんだろうとは思ったけど……。", "zh": "哦，那听起来很有意思嘛。看你打扮得这么时髦，我就猜你要出门了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "f8b6602bdd033c2b82b64dc97e515675fb02ce788cca7bb5ba90e73b1d34cf4e", "ja": "えへへ。家族のみんなと、ちゃんと出かけるのは\n久しぶりだからね。今日の自分もいい感じでしょ？", "zh": "嘿嘿。因为很久没和家人一起好好出门了。今天的我看起来也很不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "60c14b9123bf7112ac23a8be310501ec7cb38a37aab08860f4a8e6fa2f4626f3", "ja": "ああ。よく似合ってて、かわいいぞ。\nでも出かけるなら、なんで劇場に……？", "zh": "啊，很适合你，挺可爱的。\n不过要出门的话，为什么还要来剧场……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "8619c66a32e183a8669684d249fa839969b98348f48b3d8a71fb2903cad16033", "ja": "あっ、そうだった！　あのね、いぬ美が\n{$P$}も一緒がいいって言うんだ。", "zh": "啊，对了！那个……伊努美说也想和{$P$}一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1008_p", "source_sha256": "180ddd339e90e7ad6cd8831d5e331d6e0a2cd8050bd872144c395c23cb8af4b2", "ja": "えっ、いぬ美が？", "zh": "诶，犬美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "27232c7d6165391b385524db749bb7e2b18ae2715fdb3a7b59df911037def626", "ja": "うん。{$P$}のことが大好きだから、\n一緒に走りたいんだって！", "zh": "嗯。因为最喜欢{$P$}了，\n所以想一起跑步呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "5d1cce70747a8ad91dac6d9f36826a16cb35a7f222e3fd2f7773e3de5d5da004", "ja": "でも{$P$}はお仕事中でしょ？\n説得したんだけど、いぬ美はどうしても遊びたいって。", "zh": "可是{$P$}正在工作吧？\n虽然我劝过它了，但伊努美无论如何都想玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "e67feb3b2fd520b65ed64216f3b15faab68525c1004b9ed0f25e3b137d57b21c", "ja": "自分、どうしたらいいかわからなくなっちゃって。\nそれで、直接聞きにきたんだ。", "zh": "我都不知道该怎么办了。\n所以就直接来问了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3277becd2fae3d303eca86bcd1955271be76287eacc3c56507f9af3674bba929", "ja": "そういうことだったのか。一緒に行きたいけど、\n仕事を途中で投げ出すわけにはいかないからな……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。我也想一起去，可不能把工作做到一半就丢下不管……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "a05c8ffb99e72967bfa2e911fa3ecd07eb382717c6026ef74cb581a3a3914593", "ja": "うん、そうだね。仕事の途中で遊びに行くなんて、\n自分だってやらないぞ。それがプロだもんね！", "zh": "嗯，说得对。怎么能在工作做到一半时跑出去玩呢，\n就算是我也不会这么做的。这才叫专业嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "0c5b853f8c3acbca15882f0dea6223d8310e25fcb93e695810f77a2e504cd38c", "ja": "いぬ美はいい子だから、ちゃんと説明したら、\nわかってくれると思う……。だから、また今度遊んで！", "zh": "犬美是个好孩子，只要好好向它解释，\n我觉得它会理解的……所以，下次再陪它玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "a068b4bcf183233b5eb81e0d01975ffc6a244c70233f9759275845d484f21402", "ja": "邪魔してごめんね、{$P$}。\nじゃあ、自分は……。", "zh": "抱歉打扰了，{$P$}。那我就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1873299f5b5720d2fedb931dc1fd3aa8f1f89f71c7c44ba9eb2ed73f124bdc30", "ja": "待ってくれ、響！\nドッグパークの場所、教えてくれないか？", "zh": "等等，响！\n能告诉我狗公园在哪里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "f0040d07def7075e64dd7f6a46e3485677751f011ce013473b447f50c5a12847", "ja": "{$P$}？\n別にいいけど……どうして？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n倒是无所谓啦……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1018_p", "source_sha256": "612dfb26d63780988cf21520644830cd5d3475a9b37223ea48b066f4ba17d169", "ja": "ん？　俺もいぬ美たちに会いたいと思ってね。\n仕事が終わったら向かうから、遅くなるけど……。", "zh": "嗯？我也想见见犬美它们啊。\n等工作结束后我再过去，所以会比较晚就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "bd29c724fe2571f17aad12cac24bb06c072ca5e2ddff47fcf9732075b8a1770c", "ja": "えっ……ホント！？　やった～♪\n{$P$}と一緒にお出かけだ～！", "zh": "咦……真的！？太好了～♪\n要和{$P$}一起出门啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "fd8c54970b008605610624412078f9f5b6f850f1031eeaeecd0762cffb71508d", "ja": "はっ……！　え、えっと、いぬ美たちも、\nすっごく喜ぶんじゃないかなーって。……あははっ。", "zh": "啊……！呃、那个，我是想说，いぬ美它们应该也会特别高兴吧……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7238807f4f4d3dac41331789f39327b5f15f7185ff42ceff3d0aa1a482b6aa71", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。\n響たちのためにも、早く仕事を終わらせないとな！", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。为了响她们，也得赶紧把工作做完才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "25e63797dd49e39548de13c17d0b56212cf6b49bb23b4c1decc0813294d721a0", "ja": "うん！　頑張ってね、{$P$}！\n自分は、いぬ美たちと先に行ってるね～！", "zh": "嗯！加油哦，{$P$}！\n我先和犬美它们一起走啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0324_1023_p", "source_sha256": "30e18e5b1274bc4f85775ac9b01943aeb710f145d103145ccf83829e96145e83", "ja": "（早めに仕事を終わらせると、響やいぬ美たちと\n思いきり遊んだ。……いいリフレッシュになったな！）", "zh": "（提前结束工作后，和响以及犬美它们尽情玩了一场。……真是好好放松了一下！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
